WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.334
Sharper thresholds, as conjectured.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.496
Add random edges and properties flip from unlikely

3
00:00:05.496 --> 00:00:07.767
to likely. How narrow is the switch?

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.487
Freeze everything outside a random block; symmetry inside it caps every influence.

5
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.642
Claimed: width one over log n squared.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:19.308
Lean covers only part.
